  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2022-junio-7",
   "n": 7,
   "bloque": "B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Se consideran los vectores \\(\\vec u=(-1,2,3)\\) y \\(\\vec v=(2,0,-1)\\), así como el punto \\(A(-4,4,7)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Calcula \\(a\\) y \\(b\\) para que el vector \\(\\vec w=(1,a,b)\\) sea ortogonal a \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\).",
     "(1,75 p.) Determina los cuatro vértices de un paralelogramo cuyos lados tienen las direcciones de los vectores \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\), y que tiene al vector \\(\\overrightarrow{OA}\\) como una de sus diagonales, siendo \\(O\\) el origen de coordenadas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\vec w\\perp\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec w\\perp\\vec v\\) significan producto escalar nulo<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(\\vec x\\perp\\vec y\\iff\\vec x\\cdot\\vec y=0\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\vec w\\cdot\\vec u=-1+2a+3b=0\\qquad\\vec w\\cdot\\vec v=2-b=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ b=2,\\ \\ -1+2a+6=0\\Rightarrow a=-\\tfrac52\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=-\\dfrac52\\) y \\(b=2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Los lados del paralelogramo son paralelos a \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{OA}\\) es una diagonal: \\(\\overrightarrow{OA}\\) es suma de un múltiplo de \\(\\vec u\\) y otro de \\(\\vec v\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>La diagonal que sale de \\(O\\) es la suma de los dos lados que salen de \\(O\\): \\(\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\lambda\\vec u+\\mu\\vec v\\). Entonces los vértices son \\(O\\), \\(\\lambda\\vec u\\), \\(\\mu\\vec v\\) y \\(A\\).</i>:</p>\\[(-4,4,7)=\\lambda(-1,2,3)+\\mu(2,0,-1)\\iff\\begin{cases}-\\lambda+2\\mu=-4\\\\2\\lambda=4\\\\3\\lambda-\\mu=7\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\lambda=2,\\ \\mu=-1\\]<p>(la 1.ª ecuación: \\(-2-2=-4\\) ✓). Los lados desde \\(O\\) son \\(2\\vec u=(-2,4,6)\\) y \\(-\\vec v=(-2,0,1)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-10,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[0,0,0],[-2,4,6],[-4,4,7],[-2,0,1]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"vec\",[0,0,0],[-1,2,3],\"#64748b\",\"u\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0,0,0],[2,0,-1],\"#64748b\",\"v\",4,-4],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[-4,4,7],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"O\",-14,4],[\"pt\",[-2,4,6],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-4,4,7],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-2,0,1],\"D\",7,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='g2n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='g2d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='g2g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='g2r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='34.0,207.6 116.8,56.4 108.8,18.0 26.0,169.2' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='34.0' y1='207.6' x2='75.4' y2='132.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#g2g)'/><text x='79.4' y='128.0' fill='#64748b' font-weight='700'>u</text><line x1='34.0' y1='207.6' x2='42.0' y2='246.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#g2g)'/><text x='46.0' y='242.0' fill='#64748b' font-weight='700'>v</text><line x1='34.0' y1='207.6' x2='108.8' y2='18.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='34.0' cy='207.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='20.0' y='211.6' font-weight='700'>O</text><circle cx='116.8' cy='56.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='123.8' y='50.4' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='108.8' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='115.8' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='169.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='181.2' font-weight='700'>D</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='26.8' y2='275.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='24.8' y='282.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='39.8' y2='269.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.3' y='272.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Vértices: \\(O(0,0,0)\\), \\(B(-2,4,6)\\), \\(A(-4,4,7)\\) y \\(D(-2,0,1)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(B+D-O=(-4,4,7)=A\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
